                <mxCell id="113" value="&lt;b&gt;Why functions, not classes?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Literal[id1, id2, ...] is only known at runtime, after the domain loads. create_model() builds a new Pydantic class dynamically. @lru_cache memoizes it so each domain pays the build cost once." style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1">
