                <mxCell id="122" value="There is alot in def respond().." style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1510" y="-470" width="100" height="100" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="124" value="&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(97, 97, 97); background-color: rgb(243, 243, 243);&quot;&gt;The key design point: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(97, 97, 97); background-color: rgb(243, 243, 243);&quot;&gt;the rules drive the tutor, not the other way around.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(97, 97, 97); background-color: rgb(243, 243, 243);&quot;&gt; The move is determined before any text is written, so the error-first ordering (REFLECT before REMEDIATE) holds by construction rather than by the model&#39;s goodwill.&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1100" y="-640" width="240" height="160" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="125" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;entryX=0.725;entryY=0.004;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" parent="1" source="124" target="115" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="227" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=40;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" parent="1" source="126" target="122" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
